            <h1>Dental Implant Cost in China (2026)</h1>
            <p>Compare implant costs across China, US, Thailand, and Mexico — with named hospital prices, All-on-4/All-on-6 breakdowns, patient case, expert data, and risk guidance.</p>
            <div class="article-meta">
