                            <strong>Single Premium Implant:</strong> $700–$1,200<br>
                            <strong>Notes:</strong> Modern digital workflows, CAD/CAM restorations, proximity to Hong Kong. Appeals to patients wanting private-clinic speed and technology.</p>
                            <span class="price-tag">From $700 per implant</span>
